  heading: "Nancy Fischer Estate Sale"
  paragraphs:
    - "Perched in the NW hills in an almost secret neighborhood just off Cornell, you'll find the hidden gem of Nancy Fisher's estate. A collection of vintage furniture, worldly decor, and stylish fine art ideal for any treasure hunter. Great items in versatile wingback chairs and divine serving china to the gorgeous dining room table and buffet sideboard cabinet, and you can't pass up the trendy lamps and lighting. There's plenty of other charms and trinkets belonging to a sophisticated collector, including vintage jewelry and clothing, Asian pottery, Waterford crystal glassware, lots of kitchen and cookware, and a like-new Peloton machine and workout kit. Not to mention a Christmas room, just in time for the holidays! We'll also have convenient bargain shopping options when you enter and exit through the garage full of even more furniture, art, and decor."
